@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Trainee Records Maintenance

actor Trainee
participant "Web Application" as App
database "SQLite Database" as DB
actor "District Officer" as DO

Trainee -> App: Open maintenance module
App -> DB: Retrieve assigned tasks
DB --> App: Return task information
App --> Trainee: Display available tasks
Trainee -> App: Select borehole and submit repair details
App -> App: Validate submitted information

alt Information is valid
    App -> DB: Save maintenance record
    DB --> App: Confirm successful save
    App -> DB: Update task progress
    DB --> App: Confirm progress update
    App --> Trainee: Display success message
    App -> DO: Make progress available for monitoring
else Information is invalid
    App --> Trainee: Display validation error
end
@enduml
